.TH TEXTANALYST-QT 1 "2026-08-29" "textanalyst-qt 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
textanalyst-qt \- high-performance text log filtering and marking tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B textanalyst-qt
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIfile\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
TextAnalyst-Qt loads a text/log file with an mmap snapshot and a lazy line
index (1 GiB file opens in under 500 ms), applies include/exclude filter
rules (substring or PCRE2-backed regex), supports 8 line-marker colors with
circular jump, and keeps the original TextAnalyst (.tat) filter format.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show this help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-file " " \fIpath\fR
Open \fIpath\fR (overrides the positional argument).
.TP
.BR \-\-line " " \fIn\fR
Jump to line \fIn\fR after the file is opened.
.TP
.BR \-\-grep " " \fIpattern\fR
Filter to lines matching \fIpattern\fR (include rule).
.TP
.BR \-\-load " " \fIfile.tat\fR
Load filter rules from a .tat file once the document is open.
.TP
.BR \-\-export " " \fIfile\fR
Export visible lines (hidden and dimmed rows are skipped).
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-restore
Skip the last-session restore.
.TP
.BR \-\-verbose
Verbose logging on stderr.
.TP
.BR \-\-compact\-memory
Enable MADV_DONTNEED unloading (experimental, off by default).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/textanalyst-qt/textanalyst-qt.conf
User preferences (QSettings).
.TP
.I ~/.cache/textanalyst-qt/textanalyst-qt.log
Runtime log (4 MiB per file, up to 4 rotated backups, 20 MiB total).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B QT_QPA_PLATFORM
Force a platform plugin (e.g. \fBxcb\fR when debugging under Wayland).
.TP
.B QT_SCALE_FACTOR
Global HiDPI scale factor.
.TP
.B LANG
UI language (e.g. \fBzh_CN.UTF-8\fR).
.TP
.B QT_IM_MODULE
Input method module (e.g. \fBfcitx\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
The project documentation set: architecture.md(7), detailed-design.md(7)
in /usr/share/doc/textanalyst-qt.